 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey! How's everything going?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "We adopted a rescue dog and she panics in the car. Whines, drools, the lot.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "block": "cars.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Poor girl, that's very common with rescues. Short positive trips help. Start with just sitting in the parked car with treats, engine off.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Just sitting there? Not even driving?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
   "block": "cars.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. Then engine on, then a drive to the end of the road. Build it up slowly, and end each trip somewhere fun, like the park.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, and another thing. My mum is moving into a bungalow, and the big question is her old piano.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "block": "moving_house.ctx6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a tough one. She could keep it and give up a bit of living room, or give it to a school and keep the space. Does she still play?",
   "est_sec": 9.4,
   "gap_before": 1.2,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.ctx6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sorry, go silent for a moment. My mum just came in and I need to talk to her.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.25,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instruction_v2_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Did you take my controller again?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "video_games.side2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Mine ran out of battery. I'll give it back.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 3.39,
   "block": "video_games.side2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "You said that yesterday.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "block": "video_games.side2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Okay, okay. It's on the couch, under the blanket.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "block": "video_games.side2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the charger?",
